<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LOWERS FEES ON SHARE DEALS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LOWERS FEES ON SHARE DEALS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank said on Thursday that it cut by half the commission fees it charges for deals involving shares quoted on the Tallinn bourse.</p>
<p>Its new commission fee is 0.5 percent of the sum and the minimum sum of the deal is 195.00 kroons, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
